# tuned/nccl.pins -- which zbrad/nccl release llama.cpp links, per variant and toolkit.
#   <variant> <toolkit id> <release tag>
# A toolkit listed here gets that NCCL, linked statically into libggml-cuda (no libnccl.so is shipped). A toolkit
# with no line here uses the system libnccl2 whose version tuned/common-data/toolkits/<id>.env pins
# (TOOLKIT_NCCL_VERSION); a toolkit that declares "none" and has no line here cannot be built (tuned/env.sh).
# Move a pin deliberately, in its own commit: the NCCL in the package follows this line.
